@startuml
title Ambient binder handler: float-then-AC-reduce (who owns each step)

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3
skinparam activity {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}

|#DBEAFE|Report Compiler|
start
:Ambient term\n(typed AST, maybe Ambiguous); <<#DBEAFE>>
:call `try_direct_eval`\n= the binder NativeHandler; <<#DBEAFE>>

|#FAE8FF|Binder NativeHandler|
:`binder_congruence_nf`; <<#FAE8FF>>
repeat :`__bcn_float_pass`\n(bottom-up: float one level); <<#FAE8FF>>
  note right
    Capture-safe: moniker `unbind`
    FRESHENS the binder (x → x'),
    `Scope::new` re-closes locally.
    Never `from_parts_unsafe`.
  end note
repeat while (`term_eq` fixpoint?) is (no) not (yes — all `new`s at top)
:Re-close the `new`-run in\nα-canonical (FIX-A) order\n(NewComm); <<#FAE8FF>>
:Binder-free soup\nunder one canonical `new`-run; <<#FAE8FF>>

|#FEF3C7|AC e-graph engine|
:Build exact-keyed e-graph\nfrom the soup; <<#BBF7D0>>
:Saturate with `In`/`Out`/`OpenRule`\n(`AcApp` matching, lazy selection); <<#FEF3C7>>
note right
  AC ambiguity preserved:
  every valid pairing is a
  distinct e-node. Weight
  orders; nothing is pruned.
end note
if (saturation outcome?) then (Converged)
  :SatReport = Converged; <<#DCFCE7>>
else (NodeLimit / IterationLimit)
  :SatReport = bounded; <<#FFEDD5>>
endif

|#FBCFE8|Extractor + Report|
:Exact lazy N-best extraction; <<#FBCFE8>>
if (cycle cut?) then (no)
  :completeness = Complete; <<#BBF7D0>>
else (yes)
  :completeness = BoundedByCycleCut; <<#FFEDD5>>
endif
:Build `DovetailRunReport`; <<#EDE9FE>>

|#DBEAFE|Report Compiler|
:Return Some(report)\n(None if nothing progressed\n— fail-closed preserved); <<#DBEAFE>>
stop

legend right
|= Lane / color |= Owner |
|<#DBEAFE> Report Compiler | calls the handler, returns the report |
|<#FAE8FF> Binder NativeHandler | float `new`s out, capture-safe, α-canonical |
|<#FEF3C7> AC e-graph engine | saturate the binder-free soup, AcApp rules |
|<#FBCFE8> Extractor + Report | N-best extraction, completeness, run report |
|<#FFEDD5> Boundary | bounded outcome (honest, not Complete) |
endlegend
@enduml
